}$ into a repeated decimal using long division." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489196 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2953724f-e9c5-5a58-a253-c1d894297cc0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489196 #edb/ref 1074 "To write the fraction as a decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n79 \\div 6\n$$\n\nWe proceed using long division as usual, continuing until a repeating pattern of digits appears after the decimal point:\n\n![](images/3c/3c9add129b16a1dedeb68e0397f6345d7f481f3bbfdd54c0a35067abaaa15263.svg)\n\nWe could continue the division, but the same digit keeps repeating. Thus, the decimal continues with repeating $6$'s:\n\n$$\n13.16\\ldots\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{79}{6} = 13.16\\ldots = 13.1\\overline{6}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186489124 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1069 "q-357505" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1071 "Convert $\\frac{47}{6}$ into a repeating decimal using long division." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2e203a6d-9350-554f-8fa6-0f2ee030fe0b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186489200 #edb/ref 1074 "To write the fraction as a decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n47÷6\n$$\n\nWe proceed using long division as usual, continuing until a repeating pattern of digits appears after the decimal point:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">\n<br/><br/><table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\"></td>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"6\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\,\\,7\\,.\\,8\\,3\\,3\\,…$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"6\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{4\\,\\phantom{|}7\\,.\\,0\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}0}$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td><td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$5$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-$</td><td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\